---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | Kaffy Olaitan" description="How Kaffy Olaitan collects and uses personal information on this website.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Privacy" title="Privacy policy" />
  <section class="section white">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h2>What this covers</h2>
      <p>This policy explains what information is collected on kaffyolaitan.com and how it is used.</p>
      <h2>Forms</h2>
      <p>When you send a contact or speaking enquiry, your details (such as your name, email, phone number, organisation and message) are used only to reply to you and to arrange any work we agree. They are never sold.</p>
      <h2>The Business Growth Letter</h2>
      <p>If you subscribe, your name and email address are used only to send the newsletter. You will only be added if you tick the consent box, and you can unsubscribe at any time using the link in any email, or by getting in touch.</p>
      <h2>Embedded videos</h2>
      <p>Videos are embedded from YouTube in privacy-enhanced mode. YouTube may set cookies when you play a video, under its own privacy policy.</p>
      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>This site may use analytics to understand which pages are visited and which buttons are used. This helps improve the site and does not identify you personally.</p>
      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>You can ask to see, correct or delete any information held about you through the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
      <p><em>Last updated: November 2026.</em></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
